#   skills/                            -> github.com/anthropics/skills
#   graphify/                          -> github.com/safishamsi/graphify
#   tools/OpenCLI/                     -> github.com/jackwener/OpenCLI
#   tools/x-article-in-obsidian-built/ -> github.com/Icy-Cat/x-article-in-obsidian
#   tools/substack-in-obsidian-built/  -> 本地 build 產物（無 remote）
/skills/
/graphify/
/tools/OpenCLI/
/tools/x-article-in-obsidian-built/
/tools/substack-in-obsidian-built/

# === Horizon digest（vendored 上游 + .venv + 每日產出資料，共 ~870M）===
digest/ai/horizon/
digest/stock/horizon/

# === Generated output / runtime data ===
digest/ai/output/
digest/ai/migration_backup/
